  description: >
    Self-similar fractal expansion. A 3x3 motif with one fg color on a 9x9 grid
    acts as both a block-placement mask and the stamp. For each fg pixel in the
    motif at (r,c), the entire motif is pasted into the (r,c)-th 3x3 block.
  grid: 9x9 (= N^2 x N^2 where N=3) [observed N=3 only]
  background: 0
  motif:
    size: 3x3 (square, = N x N)
